This code demonstrates an insecure login feature where the username and password are not sanitized, allowing SQL injection. The secure version checks for the presence of 'or' in the inputs to prevent some common injection techniques. Use this for educational purposes only, and always ensure your applications sanitize inputs in production environments.<｜end▁of▁sentence｜>

